
On macos, <function><up-arrow> serves as page-up



Commands that follow <ctrl>x:
a: Open the agent picker/list (agent_list)
b: Toggle side bar
c: Compact session
e: Open the editor (editor_open)
h: Toggle help, tips, or concealed messages (messages_toggle_conceal / tips_toggle)
l: List session (also allows pinning, deleting, and renaming)
m: Open the model list (model_list)
n: Start a new session (session_new)
q: Exit the application (app_exit)
r: Redo last message (messages_redo)
r: Redo undone message
s: Status view
t: View theme list (theme_list)
u: Undo last message
x: Export the current session (session_export)
y: Copy last message
y: Copy messages or session info (session_copy / messages_copy)
